   1                       *2763
   2 002763  7300  START,  CLA CLL
   3 002764  3776  LOOP,   DCA I MYPTR     / Clear a word, starting at 3000
   4               / BUGBUG: When the ISZ skips, we think we're done.
   5               / Reversed these two instructions to work around the problem.
   6               /       ISZ MYPTR       / Bump pointer
   7               /       TAD START       / Reached ourself?
   8 002765  1363          TAD START       / Reached ourself?
   9 002766  2376          ISZ MYPTR       / Bump pointer
  10 002767  7640          SZA CLA 
  11 002770  5364  MYJMP,  JMP LOOP        / No, keep going
  12 002771  1376          TAD MYPTR       / Yes, get pointer
  13 002772  3000  MYDCA,  DCA 0           / Store at zero
  14 002773  3376          DCA MYPTR       / Clear a couple of words
  15 002774  3370          DCA MYJMP       / So we can fall through
  16 002775  3372          DCA MYDCA       / without mangling 0 or DCA I 0
  17 002776  3000  MYPTR,  .+2             / Where to clear next.
  18 002777  3400          DCA I 0         / Clear a word, fall through again
  19               $

LOOP    2764
MYDCA   2772
MYJMP   2770
MYPTR   2776
START   2763
